nce for the 200H limit.\n\n**Optional (strengthens paper): Retitle to foreground empirical contribution.** 'Commitment Depth Routing' implies a novel routing mechanism as the primary contribution. The actual primary contribution is Phase 1 — the first empirical study of which manipulation phases need τ_v < 1 in 3D WAMs. A title like 'When Does Robot Policy Need Video? Manipulation-Phase Analysis and Selective Activation for World Action Models' better positions the paper as an empirical methods contribution and reduces reviewer expectations of architectural novelty.",
